near-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.88s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:0.9600000000000001s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.04s"></div></div><span>Or your own models, behind your own URL — anything OpenAI-compatible</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex h-[16rem] min-h-0 w-full flex-col sm:h-[19rem]"><div class="relative h-full min-h-0 w-full"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-x-4 -top-34 bottom-18 sm:-inset-x-8 sm:-top-38 lg:-inset-x-12 lg:-top-50" style="opacity:0"><canvas aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground block h-full w-full"></canvas></div><div class="border-border bg-background absolute inset-x-4 bottom-0 flex items-stretch rounded-lg border sm:inset-x-8" style="opacity:0"><span class="border-border relative flex w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-r"><span class="text-foreground absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center" style="opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5"><title>Claude</title><path d="M4.709 15.955l4.72-2.647.08-.23-.08-.128H9.2l-.79-.048-2.698-.073-2.339-.097-2.266-.122-.571-.121L0 11.784l.055-.352.48-.321.686.06 1.52.103 2.278.158 1.652.097 2.449.255h.389l.055-.157-.134-.098-.103-.097-2.358-1.596-2.552-1.688-1.336-.972-.724-.491-.364-.462-