-[12.5px] leading-tight">Opened a change request</span><span class="shrink-0 text-[10.5px] leading-tight text-muted-foreground/60">for a human to read</span></li></ul><p class="text-muted-foreground/70 border-border border-t pt-2.5 font-mono text-[10.5px]">agents/kortix.md · permission.bash → <span class="text-kortix-red">git push: deny</span></p></div></div></div></div></article><article data-stack-layer="computer" class="border-border bg-popover flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border"><div class="flex w-full items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 sm:px-6"><span class="text-muted-foreground/60 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest tabular-nums">05</span><h3 class="text-foreground truncate text-[15px] font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-base">Every session gets its own computer.</h3></div><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 border-t p-2 flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 px-2 pt-2"><p class="text-muted-foreground text-[13px] leading-relaxed">The harness needs somewhere to run. Each session boots its own isolated Linux machine with your repo and your tools already on it — nothing to install, no laptop involved.</p><ul class="text-muted-foreground space-y-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed"><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6800000000000002s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.76s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.84s"></div></div><span>Session id, sandbox id and branch name are one and the same string</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6800000000000002s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.76s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.84s"></div></div><span>The agent can install, run and break anything — only commits survive</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.6800000000000002s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.76s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:1.84s"></div></div><span>Thousands run in parallel with no crossover between them</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex h-[16rem] min-h-0 w-full flex-col sm:h-[19rem]"><div class="h-full w-full"><div class="flex h-full min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-3 pt-4 sm:pt-5"></div></div></div></div></div></article><article data-stack-layer="control-plane" class="border-border bg-popover flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border"><div class="flex w-full items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 sm:px-6"><span class="text-muted-foreground/60 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest tabular-nums">06</span><h3 class="text-foreground truncate text-[15px] font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-base">One place to start it, one gate to land it.</h3></div><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 border-t p-2 flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 px-2 pt-2"><p class="text-muted-foreground text-[13px] leading-relaxed">Start, watch and steer every agent in the organization — from the web app, from Slack, from your terminal, or from nobody at all. Then the work commits back into the repo you started from.</p><ul class="text-muted-foreground space-y-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed"><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.08s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.16s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.24s"></div></div><span>Web, Slack, mobile, CLI and API all start the same session</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.08s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.16s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.24s"></div></div><span>Cron schedules and signed webhooks start sessions with no one asking</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><div class="relative flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center mt-0 size-4"><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-10" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-20 rotate-90" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.08s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-30 rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.16s"></div><div class="absolute h-3.5 w-px shrink-0 rounded-full animate-kortix-bullet-flow bg-[length:100%_300%] z-40 -rotate-45" style="background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--kortix-red), var(--kortix-green), var(--kortix-blue), var(--kortix-yellow), var(--kortix-purple), var(--kortix-red));animation-delay:2.24s"></div></div><span>Session work lands on main as a change request you read as a diff first</span></li></ul></div><div class="flex h-[16rem] min-h-0 w-full flex-col sm:h-[19rem]"><div class="bg-muted/40 relative flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="shrink-0 px-5 pt-4 sm:px-8 sm:pt-6"></div><div class="border-border bg-background mx-auto mt-4 flex min-h-0 w-[92%] flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-t-xl border border-b-0 px-4 pt-4 shadow-sm sm:px-6 sm:pt-5"><div class="mx-auto flex h-full w-full max-w-lg items-center pb-5"></div></div><div role="status" class="sr-only"></div></div></div></div></article></div></div></section>"`;

exports[`desktop retains six ordered panels 1`] = `"<section id="platform-stack" class="relative space-y-24 md:space-y-30"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 pt-[4.75rem] [@media(max-height:860px)]:pt-[4.5rem]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 select-none"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-[0.75rem] leading-none font-normal uppercase select-none" data-text="true">The Kortix stack</span><h2 data-heading="true" class="text-foreground max-w-2xl font-sans text-2xl font-medium text-balance sm:text-3xl">Every layer an AI workforce needs — in one platform you own.</h2></div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed">Most tools hand you one layer and rent you the rest. Kortix is all six — they read in order, and the sixth commits the work back into the first.</p></div><div class="mx-auto mt-8 w-full max-w-7xl px-6 pb-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-[14rem_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-10 xl:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)]"><nav aria-label="The Kortix stack" class="sticky top-30 flex flex-col gap-1 pt-1"><button type="button" data-stack-layer="source" data-active="true" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="bg-foreground absolute top-1/2 left-0 -mt-2.5 h-5 w-0.5 rounded-full"></span><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-foreground">Source of truth</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="context" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Context &amp; connections</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="models" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Large language models</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="harness" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Agentic harness</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="computer" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Agent computer</span></button><button type="button" data-stack-layer="control-plane" data-active="false" class="group relative flex cursor-pointer items-baseline gap-3 py-2 pl-4 text-left"><span class="text-base font-medium tracking-tight transition-colors duration-200 text-muted-foreground/40 group-hover:text-muted-foreground">Control plane</span></button></nav><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-24 xl:gap-30"><div id="stack-pane-source" data-stack-pane="source" class="scroll-mt-30"><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-col space-y-10"><p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-snug tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-xl"><span class="text-foreground font-medium">One git repo that is the company.</span> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Agents, skills, memory, connector config and triggers are all text in one repo. Not settings in someone else’s database — files you own.</span></p><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 flex h-88 min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border sm:h-112 xl:h-128"><div class="flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2"><ul class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-2"><li class="bg-background flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 max-w-98 border-border shadow-sm" style="opacity:0"><span class="bg-card text-foreground flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-4"><path d="M197.58,129.06,146,110l-19-51.62a15.92,15.92,0,0,0-29.88,0L78,110l-51.62,19a15.92,15.92,0,0,0,0,29.88L78,178l19,51.62a15.92,15.92,0,0,0,29.88,0L146,178l51.62-19a15.92,15.92,0,0,0,0-29.88ZM137,164.22a8,8,0,0,0-4.74,4.74L112,223.85,91.78,169A8,8,0,0,0,87,164.22L32.15,144,87,123.78A8,8,0,0,0,91.78,119L112,64.15,132.22,119a8,8,0,0,0,4.74,4.74L191.85,144ZM144,40a8,8,0,0,1,8-8h16V16a8,8,0,0,1,16,0V32h16a8,8,0,0,1,0,16H184V64a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V48H152A8,8,0,0,1,144,40ZM248,88a8,8,0,0,1-8,8h-8v8a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V96h-8a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h8V72a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v8h8A8,8,0,0,1,248,88Z"></path></svg></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><span class="text-foreground truncate text-sm font-medium">New skill: weekly report</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-xs">Skills</span></span><span class="text-muted-foreground shrink-0 text-xs tabular-nums">now</span></li><li class="bg-background flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 max-w-92 border-border/60" style="opacity:0"><span class="bg-card text-foreground flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-4"><path d="M208,40H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,56v56c0,52.72,25.52,84.67,46.93,102.19,23.06,18.86,46,25.27,47,25.53a8,8,0,0,0,4.2,0c1-.26,23.91-6.67,47-25.53C198.48,196.67,224,164.72,224,112V56A16,16,0,0,0,208,40Zm0,72c0,37.07-13.66,67.16-40.6,89.42A129.3,129.3,0,0,1,128,223.62a128.25,128.25,0,0,1-38.92-21.81C61.82,179.51,48,149.3,48,112l0-56,160,0Z"></path></svg></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><span class="text-foreground truncate text-sm font-medium">Finance can read billing</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-xs">Rules</span></span><span class="text-muted-foreground shrink-0 text-xs tabular-nums">2m</span></li><li class="bg-background flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 max-w-87 border-border/60" style="opacity:0"><span class="bg-card text-foreground flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="size-4"><path d="M215.79,118.17a8,8,0,0,0-5-5.66L153.18,90.9l14.66-73.33a8,8,0,0,0-13.69-7l-112,120a8,8,0,0,0,3,13l57.63,21.61L88.16,238.43a8,8,0,0,0,13.69,7l112-120A8,8,0,0,0,215.79,118.17ZM109.37,214l10.47-52.38a8,8,0,0,0-5-9.06L62,132.71l84.62-90.66L136.16,94.43a8,8,0,0,0,5,9.06l52.8,19.8Z"></path></svg></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><span class="text-foreground truncate text-sm font-medium">Runs every Monday at 9:00</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-xs">Triggers</span></span><span class="text-muted-foreground shrink-0 text-xs tabular-nums">1h</span></li><li class="bg-background flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border px-4 py-3 max-w-81 border-border/60" style="opacity:0"><span class="bg-card text-foreground flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"><span aria-hidden="true" data-slot="agent-mark" style="--mark-tile:light-dark(#EEE6F0, #5E3A68);--mark-ink:light-dark(#5E3A68, #EEE6F0);width:30px;height:30px" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-(--mark-tile) rounded-sm" data-state="closed"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="14" height="14" style="width:14px;height:14px" viewBox="0 0 7 7" shape-rendering="crispEdges" class="shrink-0"><path d="M0 1h2v1h-2zM3 1h1v1h-1zM5 1h2v1h-2zM0 2h1v1h-1zM2 2h3v1h-3zM6 2h1v1h-1zM0 3h7v1h-7zM1 4h1v1h-1zM3 4h1v1h-1zM5 4h1v1h-1zM0 5h2v1h-2zM5 5h2v1h-2z" class="fill-(--mark-ink)"></path></svg></span></span><span class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col"><span class="text-foreground truncate text-sm font-medium">Support agent added</span><span class="text-muted-foreground text-xs">Agents</span></span><span class="text-muted-foreground shrink-0 text-xs tabular-nums">3h</span></li></ul><p class="text-muted-foreground pt-3 text-sm" style="opacity:0">Every change lands in <span class="text-foreground font-mono">acme-co</span></p></div></div></div></div><div id="stack-pane-context" data-stack-pane="context" class="scroll-mt-30"><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-col space-y-10"><p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-snug tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-xl"><span class="text-foreground font-medium">Every tool your company already runs on.</span> <span class="text-muted-foreground">The repo also holds the connectors. Wire up Slack, docs, tickets, CRM, billing and code once, then scope which agent may touch which one.</span></p><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 flex h-88 min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border sm:h-112 xl:h-128"><div class="flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col justify-center gap-8"><p class="text-foreground flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 text-xl tracking-tight sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl"><span class="text-muted-foreground" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)">Your agents work in</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="28" height="28" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="size-5 sm:size-6 lg:size-7" style="color:transparent" src="/media/landing/logos/color/slack.svg"/>Slack,</span></span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 size-5 sm:size-6 lg:size-7" style="background-color:var(--foreground);mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/notion.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/notion.svg);mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center"></span>Notion,</span></span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 size-5 sm:size-6 lg:size-7" style="background-color:#5E6AD2;mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/linear.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/linear.svg);mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center"></span>Linear,</span></span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 size-5 sm:size-6 lg:size-7" style="background-color:#FF7A59;mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/hubspot.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/hubspot.svg);mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center"></span>HubSpot,</span></span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 size-5 sm:size-6 lg:size-7" style="background-color:#635BFF;mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/stripe.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/stripe.svg);mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center"></span>Stripe</span></span><span class="text-muted-foreground" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)">and</span><span style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 size-5 sm:size-6 lg:size-7" style="background-color:var(--foreground);mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/github.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(/media/landing/logos/github.svg);mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center"></span>GitHub.</span></span></p><dl class="border-border grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 border-t pt-6 sm:grid-cols-2" style="opacity:0"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><dt class="text-foreground text-sm">Connector keys stay on the server</dt><dd class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">The session machine never sees them.</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><dt class="text-foreground text-sm">Allow, ask or block</dt><dd class="text-muted-foreground text-sm">Set per call, down to its arguments.</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></div><div id="stack-pane-models" data-stack-pane="models" class="scroll-mt-30"><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-col space-y-10"><p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-snug tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-xl"><span class="text-foreground font-medium">Run any model. Keep your keys.</span> <span class="text-muted-foreground">Kortix is model-agnostic. Pick the model per agent, per session or per message, and switch the day a better one lands.</span></p><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 flex h-88 min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border sm:h-112 xl:h-128"><div class="relative h-full min-h-0 w-full"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-x-4 -top-34 bottom-18 sm:-inset-x-8 sm:-top-38 lg:-inset-x-12 lg:-top-50" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)"><canvas aria-hidden="true" class="text-foreground block h-full w-full"></canvas></div><div class="border-border bg-background absolute inset-x-4 bottom-0 flex items-stretch rounded-lg border sm:inset-x-8" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)"><span class="border-border relative flex w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-r"><span class="text-foreground absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center" style="opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5"><title>Claude</title><path d="M4.709 15.955l4.72-2.647.08-.23-.08-.128H9.2l-.79-.048-2.698-.073-2.339-.097-2.266-.122-.571-.121L0 11.784l.055-.352.48-.