-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Models</span><span class="relative block h-6 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><span class="text-foreground block truncate text-base" style="opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none">Opus · Sonnet · Haiku</span></span></span><span class="border-border flex min-w-0 flex-col justify-center gap-0.5 px-4 py-3 w-24 shrink-0 border-r-0 sm:w-28"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-mono text-xs tracking-wide uppercase">Mode</span><span class="relative block h-6 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><span class="text-foreground block font-mono text-sm">auto</span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="stack-pane-harness" data-stack-pane="harness" class="scroll-mt-30"><div class="flex min-h-0 flex-col space-y-10"><p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-snug tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-xl"><span class="text-foreground font-medium">The part that turns a model into an agent.</span> <span class="text-muted-foreground">A model on its own answers. The harness gives it planning, tool use and multi-step runs it actually finishes — powered by OpenCode, configured by a file in the repo.</span></p><div class="border-border bg-muted/40 dark:bg-muted/15 flex h-88 min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border sm:h-112 xl:h-128"><div class="flex h-full min-h-0 w-full flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="hidden h-full grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.85fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:grid"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 px-7 py-7" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-foreground text-[13px] leading-tight font-medium">A model on its own</span><span class="text-muted-foreground/60 truncate text-[11px] leading-tight">answers</span></div><p class="text-foreground/80 text-[13.5px] leading-[1.65] text-pretty"></p><p class="text-muted-foreground/70 mt-auto text-[12.5px] italic">…and then you go and do it.</p></div><div class="border-border bg-background/40 flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 border-l px-7 py-7" style="opa